res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-1082 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-1082_A01,
        res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-1082_A02 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "전략기술서는 제안서에 목적(What)을 분명히 하고, 이를 어떤 솔루션으로 어떻게 구현(Solution, How to)할 것인가를 결정하는 도구이다." ;
    eg:excel_row 1082 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 1082" ;
    eg:page "150.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "e82109e05951c962344a3b4dac2324ed85d796b66b62807caccaac0e36d92c19" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-1082" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-1083 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-1083_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "목적(What)이란 바로 앞에서 말한 4가지 목적(강점 강화, 약점 약화, 경쟁자의 강점 약화, 경쟁자의 약점 강화)을 말한다." ;
    eg:excel_row 1083 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 1083" ;
    eg:page "150.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "ee83a4979c6151a2eac795f9856bbc7fd9c96a8b1c20a7a1d51c7c38b92bb21c" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-1083" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-1084 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-1084_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "방법(How)은 솔루션 최적화(Solution)와 커뮤니케이션 강화(How to)로 나뉘어진다." ;
    eg:excel_row 1084 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 1084" ;
    eg:page "150.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "e0291d49d9a6839e39c7ee6c5d40ca1bb48e46daaef01ce5d6e6a934cb0e11b4" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-1084" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-1085 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-1085_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "전략이 문서화되어야 조직 내에서 지속적으로 소통(Communication)할 수 있고, 정보 습득과 토의를 통해 전략을 향상(Upgrade)시킬 수 있기 때문이다." ;
    eg:excel_row 1085 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 1085" ;
    eg:page "150.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "babccb0997625a275b7e443b25bc5a6d793f239ad7e51997317044f3fe58f016" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-1085" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-1086 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
