res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-64 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-64_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "일련의 사건 속에서 ‘쉬플리의 수주영업/전략/제안서/PT 컨설팅’이 매우 무력한 무기로 보였다." ;
    eg:excel_row 64 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 64" ;
    eg:page "25.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "3b74f2199c66c9814a87f9429a960deec759ead4b0fad284da97a4038990ac62" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-64" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-640 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-640_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "즉, 니즈 정의와 대안 검토에 세일즈의 결정적인 기회가 있으므로 고객의 구매단계 초기에 경쟁자보다 먼저 개입하는 것이 전문가 영업의 성공 여부를 좌우한다." ;
    eg:excel_row 640 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 640" ;
    eg:page "106.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "81591fdcdeaaae2132ffffd5a088983f6fa812a4adbf64ed0280febe61a97e2c" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-640" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-641 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-641_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "대안에는 대체제(Alternatives)가 있다는 점을 유념하라." ;
    eg:excel_row 641 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 641" ;
    eg:page "106.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "5448c7d6930f96422443ce3acd6e22b2279eb6d21141851808ce24d89e205fc8" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-641" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-642 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-642_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "예를 들면 우리가 머리가 아프면 두통약을 사먹을 수도 있지만 산책도 대안이 될 수 있다." ;
    eg:excel_row 642 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 642" ;
    eg:page "106.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "d766f6b358b4a78c48a3d835c789183801b3b155deeee7ea20da18985e1d4fe1" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-642" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-643 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-643_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "공장의 불량률이 높으면 자동화 프로그램을 구매할 수도 있고, 직원들을 교육하고 훈련시킬 수도 있다." ;
    eg:excel_row 643 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 643" ;
    eg:page "106.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
