    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "“김용기 씨(나는 그 때 신입사원이었다), 대부분의 지점을 찾는 고객은 이미 새 차를 구매하기로 마음을 먹은 상태의 사람들이기 때문에 차 외에는 크게 관심이 없지." ;
    eg:excel_row 782 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 782" ;
    eg:page "117.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "a4dfe58ae35752d245a0ef629bb9d2431c5b54f4e3bf01a644cecb0c95846009" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-782" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-783 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-783_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "그것이 우선 그랜저에 그를 집어넣은 첫 번째 이유야." ;
    eg:excel_row 783 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 783" ;
    eg:page "117.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "de14df0805cecd211264161e8a9938343f0e541425f53eca2262dc052873f3d0" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-783" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-784 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-784_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "중요한 또 하나의 이유는 그가 그랜저에 앉아서 화려한 계기판을 보면서 가죽 시트의 냄새를 맡는 순간, 그의 구매결정은 끝난다는 거지." ;
    eg:excel_row 784 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 784" ;
    eg:page "117.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "efaaf053d4920af9a2d28f987b7e53308b1539216c1ad1cc50391f296865537f" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-784" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-785 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-785_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "그가 맡은 천연가죽의 향긋한 냄새는 내가 하는 백 마디 말보다 더 효과적이야." ;
    eg:excel_row 785 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 785" ;
    eg:page "117.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "adf299e71a49ee89f53e4e845da0d670e3288ed51a8026dbf0edf49910bb7db5" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-785" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-786 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-786_A01,
        res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-786_A02 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "내가 아는 고객은 대부분 차가 ‘필요(needs)’하기도 하지만 사실은 좋은 차를 갖고 싶은 ‘욕망(wants)’ 때문에 차를 사지." ;
    eg:excel_row 786 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 786" ;
    eg:page "117.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
    eg:status "VALIDATED" ;
    eg:systemId "EG-MOI-V1" ;
    eg:text_sha256 "a22bd7b7eb95d6624a21543e059d07a82a94211dfbf033d30a280a240a7bad0a" ;
    eg:uid "EG-MOI-V1::egmoi:evidence/xlsx-row-786" .

res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-787 a eg:EvidenceUnit ;
    eg:HAS_ANCHOR res:EG-MOI-V1%3A%3Aegmoi%3Aevidence%2Fxlsx-row-787_A01 ;
    eg:evidence_anchor_ids "[]"^^rdf:JSON ;
    eg:exact_text "그리고 그 사실은 본인들도 모르는 경우가 많아." ;
    eg:excel_row 787 ;
    eg:label "Excel row 787" ;
    eg:page "117.0" ;
    eg:source_binary_sha256 "e8c5f174b65eccd7a50dbd2e0e216ea870a6aedfd16b3e4538d6486aea15cf1f" ;
